# Zastava Yugo 45 three-door hatchback, 1980-2008.
#
# The Yugoslav Fiat 127 derivative: 3,485 mm long, 1,540 mm wide, 1,390 mm high,
# 2,150 mm wheelbase; 903-1,116 cc four, front-wheel drive. Sold in Britain from
# 1983 as the cheapest new car on the market; later built as the Koral.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zastava_Koral
#
# Colours: White, Red, Blue and Grey are documented Yugo colours of the period.
#
# Weight: 40 in total (white 14, red 10, blue 9, grey 7).
#
# Speed 140 km/h; comfort 45/250 (line). Classes 0,1.
# Dates: 1980-2008 with a road tail to about 2014.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/yugo-45.blend. References:
# citycars/references/yugo-45/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

